│   Help: Status                                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Shows real-time status of RDD (Review-Driven Development), active SDD changes, and system health. Data is fetched from the live system on refresh.  │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Keyboard Shortcuts                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│    R  — Refresh all status data                                                                                                                      │
│    ESC  — Back to main menu                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Press ? or ESC to close help                                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                      │
